<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Starlight High School Debate Tournament 2025</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-color: #2c2c54;
      --secondary-color: #3c3c80;
      --light-bg: #f9f9ff;
      --accent-bg: #dcdcff;
      --highlight-bg: #f0f0ff;
      --hover-color: #5a5ad1;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--light-bg);
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: var(--primary-color);
      text-align: center;
      border: 3px solid var(--primary-color);
      padding: 12px;
      background-color: var(--accent-bg);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: var(--secondary-color);
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    p {
      margin: 10px 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    table {
      width: 80%;
      margin: 20px auto;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    table th, table td {
      border: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    table th {
      background-color: var(--accent-bg);
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .contact {
      border: 2px dashed var(--secondary-color);
      padding: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background-color: var(--highlight-bg);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    form {
      margin-top: 15px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    input, textarea {
      margin: 5px 0 15px 0;
      padding: 8px;
      width: 95%;
      border: 1px solid var(--secondary-color);
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    textarea {
      resize: vertical;
    }

    button {
      background-color: var(--secondary-color);
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 15px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    button:hover {
      background-color: var(--hover-color);
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        margin: 10px;
        padding: 10px;
      }

      table {
        width: 100%;
      }

      form {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Starlight High School Debate Tournament 2025</h1>

  <h2>📍 Event Details</h2>
  <p>Join us for the Annual Debate Tournament 2025 hosted by Starlight High School!  
  This year’s theme is <b>“Voices of Tomorrow.”</b>  
  Students will showcase their public speaking and critical thinking skills.</p>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Date</th>
      <th>Time</th>
      <th>Venue</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>October 15, 2025</td>
      <td>9:00 AM – 4:00 PM</td>
      <td>Starlight High Auditorium</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>🎉 Who’s Invited?</h2>
  <p>All students, teachers, parents, and alumni are invited.</p>

  <h2>📞 Contact Information</h2>
  <div class="contact">
    <p>For inquiries, reach us at:</p>
    <p><b>Email:</b> debateclub@starlighthigh.edu</p>
    <p><b>Phone:</b> +123-456-7890</p>
  </div>

  <h2>📝 RSVP Form</h2>
  <form>
    <label for="name">Full Name:</label><br>
    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Enter your name"><br>

    <label for="email">Email Address:</label><br>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email"><br>

    <label for="message">Message / Special Requests:</label><br>
    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Write here..."></textarea><br>

    <button type="submit">Submit RSVP</button>
  </form>

</body>
</html>
